{"name":"Liaison","hex":"#8c3f52","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"liaison","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thickening for sauces, typically based on egg yolks.","Communication between two parties or groups."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Synonym of liaise."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/liaison"}],"entries":[{"title":"Affair","blocks":[{"text":"An affair is a relationship typically between two people, one or both of whom are either married or in a long-term monogamous or emotionally-exclusive relationship with another person. The affair can be solely sexual, solely physical, solely emotional, or a combination of these."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Affair","wikidata":"Q1772698"},{"title":"Collaboration","blocks":[{"text":"Collaboration is the process of two or more people, entities or organizations working together to complete a task or achieve a goal. A definition that takes technology into account is “working together to create value while sharing virtual or physical space.” Collaboration is similar to cooperation. The form of leadership can be social within a decentralized and egalitarian group. Teams that work collaboratively often access greater resources, recognition and rewards when facing competition for finite resources."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/3d10_fm_de_vilafranca.jpg/330px-3d10_fm_de_vilafranca.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collaboration","wikidata":"Q1145523"},{"title":"Liaison (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Liaison is a British-French thriller television series written by Virginie Brac, directed by Stephen Hopkins and starring Vincent Cassel and Eva Green. It premiered on 24 February 2023 on Apple TV+."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/22/LiaisonTVposter.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled",